Package: panel
Version: {{VERSION}}
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Matthew Ackerman
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), adduser
Description: Network monitoring dashboard for the 808.org UDM + UPS
 Fastify + SvelteKit dashboard that polls the UniFi UDM Pro Max (SNMP +
 controller API) and a CyberPower UPS (SNMP) and serves a live web UI.
 Runs as panel.service on 127.0.0.1:4000, behind a reverse proxy.
 Configure via /etc/panel/panel.env (Salt-managed on real hosts).
